"art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@orcacat8/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/80443140/uploads/origins/86a6fd7e-9d84-4e4d-895f-8f073217e133?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d5bd67179a1b7006beabb019036892a6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/80443140/uploads/origins/86a6fd7e-9d84-4e4d-895f-8f073217e133?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d5bd67179a1b7006beabb019036892a6, https://si.imgix.net/80443140/uploads/origins/86a6fd7e-9d84-4e4d-895f-8f073217e133?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e5f43b2998e343ce462c1a3acd10c62e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/80443140/uploads/origins/86a6fd7e-9d84-4e4d-895f-8f073217e133?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f79c2e5c2a2882be530f2c79c4cff515 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hey! just wanted to say i love the way you draw Duo's together! your art looks amazing! \n\nUpon finding your art, it made me really wanna Request one for my friend (Allusunday)  and I (Lulu Megurine)\n\nthese are our characters\n\nAllusunday: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_5Dhl8jVLMCaI6y4w7TGbHkJ4_nVkfB5\n\nLulu: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1zbp4sLyYdHwYOMgCW9-10ihvI8BliM5q?usp=drive_link\n\nI was hoping you could make one where lulu looks somewhat annoyed or fired up while allusunday looks a little smug or somewhat pleased, either standing side by side or back to back!  we've always had this type of dynamic and i would really like to capture that type of feeling with your art\n\nThank you so much for your consideration!\n\nPs I was having trouble resending the points earlier so I had to cancel and make a new request I’m sorry! But I hope this is good!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@orcacat8/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0119d354/uploads/origins/8c1cc943-12d5-4bfd-b9cf-957e1b10a445?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=575ecd7e3831afbbcf3e89d8928f94f5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0119d354/uploads/origins/8c1cc943-12d5-4bfd-b9cf-957e1b10a445?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=575ecd7e3831afbbcf3e89d8928f94f5, https://si.imgix.net/0119d354/uploads/origins/8c1cc943-12d5-4bfd-b9cf-957e1b10a445?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=42d7d4fe53dc83dbbf3d89944aa4ee0e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0119d354/uploads/origins/8c1cc943-12d5-4bfd-b9cf-957e1b10a445?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a772fc3f27105b27052078a453f8ce1d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "orcat様\n\nはじめまして。絵柄が非常に好みでご依頼に参りました。\n構図などご自由ですので、先のご依頼で描かれているような2キャラ入ってるリクエストは可能でしょうか？\n下記\n剣士ちゃんと https://drive.google.com/file/d/1q_wdQxEgtz9dsz-CxAG9eViEIIK0XuZc/view?usp=drivesdk\n\n魔法使いちゃん https://drive.google.com/file/d/1x-B4uS0GF9R1fz4rc5sWJQaXGZ9oL_m9/view?usp=drivesdk\nを希望しています。\nもし可能でしたら、剣士ちゃんは少し見切れているのでイメージで補完していただいて構いません。\nよろしければよろしくお願い致します。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@orcacat8/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9f31dcbe/uploads/origins/e3d056c8-0b9d-442c-8723-e001a4d20569?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01f30c70baaea15cf07b952ba74d52b4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9f31dcbe/uploads/origins/e3d056c8-0b9d-442c-8723-e001a4d20569?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01f30c70baaea15cf07b952ba74d52b4, https://si.imgix.net/9f31dcbe/uploads/origins/e3d056c8-0b9d-442c-8723-e001a4d20569?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56ae782c8baa2552fa65f7a64631fa23 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9f31dcbe/uploads/origins/e3d056c8-0b9d-442c-8723-e001a4d20569?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80af1e08b63b02620c8f86b24992d45d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "orcatさまこんばんは……！！\n以前素敵なイラストをいただきました、らむと申します💌\n絵もお人柄もだいすき❕💞です(;_;)💞\n先ほどはマシュマロにお答えいただきありがとうございました……！😿💝さっそくリクエストに参りました🥹💖金額不足等ありましたら、お手数ですが再送をお願いいたします……！\n\n▼リクエスト内容\n以前と同じ創作カプをお願いしたいです…！\n今回はバレンタインらしいイラストで、よろしければ構図や服装などおまかせでお願いできましたら幸いです(;_;)💞\n\n▼使用用途\n個人鑑賞、キャラクターシートへの使用、今後のご依頼の参考、非商用のグッズ化、個人サイトやSNSへの掲載、SNSアイコンへの使用\n\n以下は資料になります…！\n\n😈創作男女の資料🐑\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ajCHElnAPNvsoaHoXvm4M72ziOpN34qU\n\n難しければ遠慮なくキャンセルしていただいて構いません…！\nお忙しいところ大変恐れ入りますが、ご検討よろしくお願いいたします…！🙂‍↕️💖", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}